If you really depend on short prayer timeout, then you will screw your 
game sooner or later. If a 'lucky' 7-th or 8-th level character gets it
- then it means that he had to pray and sacrifice a lot - enough reason to
limit it. I, for one, almost never get that blessing - the reason is that 
when my luck and alignment are high enough I usually don't have any reasons
to pray any more...

In short - the 'Elbereth/Balance/Arioch' blessing is the God's way to tell
you "I've given you enough already. Here, have these intrinsics and bugger
off..." :-)
